@host = http://localhost:5093
@cloudProviderKeys = 2b6344c5-8d55-4d4a-a1e8-e5efdeca60f1

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### The lists the workbench renders
GET {{host}}/api/lists

### The categories of one list
GET {{host}}/api/categories?listId={{cloudProviderKeys}}

### A fourth category, so the three-category cap becomes reachable in the form
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "listId": "{{cloudProviderKeys}}",
  "topic": "Rotation Due",
  "color": "#F59E0B"
}

### The secrets of that list
GET {{host}}/api/secrets?listId={{cloudProviderKeys}}

### One secret, used by the name check in the form
GET {{host}}/api/secrets/hetzner-api-token?listId={{cloudProviderKeys}}
